      "releaseNotes": "The Slushy Calculator Is Here!\nDeveloped by Jeffrey Morgenthaler, the Slushy Calculator turns any cocktail recipe into a properly textured frozen drink — every time.\n\n- Scales any recipe to your slushy machine's capacity (or any batch size you choose)\n- Uses your refractometer reading to calculate exactly how much simple syrup and water to add for the perfect texture\n- Estimates how many servings your batch will yield\n- Catches recipes that are too high in alcohol to slush and points you toward a fix\n- Save your slushy as a new recipe, or share it as a PDF, CSV, printed page, or plain text\n- Works for non-alcoholic drinks too\n\nFind it in the Calculators tab, or tap \"Slushy\" on any recipe to turn what you already have into a frozen drink.\n\nThanks for using Bevnap! Questions or feedback — email\nhello@lemel.dev. We read every message.",
      "primaryGenreName": "Food & Drink",
