      "releaseNotes": "- Ready for iPhone Duo. Bevnap fills the inner display with the same multi-column layouts you get on iPad, adapts as you open, close and fold the phone, and keeps its controls reachable in every pose.\n- Clearer toolbar buttons. Cancel, Save and Done now use icons that match iOS 26 and stay visible when the bar runs along the side on iPhone Duo.\n- The photo editor fits any screen. Cropping a recipe or ingredient photo sizes to the window, so no more oversized frame on iPad in landscape.\n- Username setup fixed. Capital letters no longer block creating or changing your username — the field lowercases as you type and tells you exactly what’s still needed.\n- Your color theme now applies to every Bevnap window on iPad.",
